If You distribute a Modification for a Noncommercial Purpose, the GEL RAM-derived portions remain subject to this license. You must not represent the Modification as granting commercial rights that You do not have.

Each recipient obtains any GEL RAM rights directly from the Licensor under this license upon acceptance of its terms. Distribution permitted by this section is not a sublicense of the Licensor's rights.

